            "heading_size": "h2",
            "show_divider": true,
            "body": "<h5>Kelsey Selby came to Luna Nueva as an insider to the life the brand was built for.</h5><p>Growing up in a household where good food and drink were celebrated nightly — seasonal ingredients, considered wine pairings, a table that was always set with intention — she developed an early understanding of hospitality and the specific pleasure of a room where everything feels right.</p><p>She spent her years in Los Angeles deepening it: specialty grocers and farmers markets, the best restaurants in the city, an ongoing education in what makes people feel well taken care of. A good life, she learned early, is built around great food, great drinks, and the people you share them with.</p>",
