          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>An act of hospitality.</h3>",
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "position": "left"
          }
        },
        "text_dFcrhE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>That instinct is what she brought to Luna Nueva. Knowing the bartender’s name, making sure everyone at the table feels it, caring for the people who drink this brand — that has always been an act of hospitality for her.</p><p>What she saw was that her generation lived differently, chose differently. They are selective. And when they decide to drink, they want something that feels unmistakably theirs: clean, additive-free, made with real craft, and belonging to the culture they actually live in.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "position": "left"
          }
        },
