        "text_kepgX7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Built from the ground up.</h3>",
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "enable_italic": false,
            "position": "right"
          }
        },
        "text_367phy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>She spent the last several years building Luna Nueva from the ground up: learning the liquid, cultivating the relationship with the Vivanco family distillery in the Highlands of Jalisco, and creating a presence in Los Angeles through community, events, and genuine belonging.</p><p>Luna Nueva is the first expression of a larger vision — one that sits at the intersection of hospitality, food, craft, and gathering. The tequila is where it begins, but the life it belongs to is much larger than a bottle.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true,
